00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:48.890
depressive symptoms.
- Yeah.

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:51.610
- And, in making some
of the YouTube videos

00:02:51.610 --> 00:02:55.750
that people are making on the
subject, I get a little upset.

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:56.583
